# Add co-authors as needed.
repository-code: "https://github.com/oshs/SWAT-DF"
abstract: >-
  Customized SWAT2012 implementation enabling dynamic, interannual two-way
  coupling with a Positive Multi-Attribute Utility Programming (PMAUP)
  microeconomic model. Reservoir storage conditions the agricultural
  water-restriction level; the resulting optimal crop portfolio is fed back into
  SWAT as updated HRU land-use fractions before the next simulation year.
keywords:
  - SWAT
  - PMAUP
  - hydro-economic modelling
  - dynamic coupling
  - water restriction
  - land-use change
